            <ArticleTitle>Draft Genome Sequences of Aggregatibacter actinomycetemcomitans Strains 310a and 310b.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">e01282-17</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1128/genomeA.01282-17</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report the draft genome sequences of Aggregatibacter actinomycetemcomitans strains 310a (310-TR) and 310b (310-OS). Strain 310a is a clinical isolate with a rough phenotype. Strain 310b is a laboratory-adapted isolate derived from the passage of 310a and displays a smooth phenotype.</AbstractText>
